          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194074_216428_28987"/>
          <body> specifies whether the Specification objects referring to the associated SpecificationCategory have to be used or may be used (optional) for products within the referenced ProductClass. A value of 'true' indicates that the usage is mandatory. &lt;example&gt;The specification category 'radio' may be associated 'optional' to the product class of a car; the specification category 'engine' is an example for a 'mandatory' association.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
